## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/
*.binlog

## One exception, and it is test data rather than build output. A fixture holds a hand-written
## project.assets.json so that reading restore output can be tested without restoring anything, and
## it sits under obj/ because that is where a real one lives. Ignored, it left the suite passing on
## a machine that had built it once and failing on every fresh clone.
##
## Deliberately tests/*/Fixtures rather than tests/**/Fixtures: the copies under bin/ are output and
## must stay ignored, and one path segment between the two cannot match them.
!tests/*/Fixtures/**/obj/
!tests/*/Fixtures/**/obj/project.assets.json

